    LLM: '1. Deal 3 cards + 1 trump indicator. 2. Declare: Ir (go) or pass. Must win 1+ trick if going. 3. Exchange cards (0-3). If exchanging 3, get 4 and keep best 3. 4. Play 3 tricks. Follow suit. Must trump if void. 5. First trick: Must lead Ace of trumps if held. 6. Second trick: Must lead highest trump.',
